      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"the exit door is always unlocked\"... that's a pretty dark way to put it. it's almost like you're saying it's just a matter of whether or not we want to be free from it all. does it really feel that simple to you? like, is there any actual reason to stay if the exit is right there?",
